# Keep the build context small and, more importantly, keep secrets and stale
# build output out of every image layer.
#
# This file must use LF line endings. With CRLF the trailing carriage return
# becomes part of each pattern and none of them match - which silently means
# .env gets copied into the image.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

**/bin/
**/obj/
**/publish/
**/.vs/
**/.idea/

# The image builds the web project only; the tests are not part of it.
tests/

.git/
.gitignore
*.md
